{"text": "Marchbanks & Yoder, CPAs\n\nMarchbanks & Yoder, CPAs\n212 West Main Street, Suite 3 · Bozeman, Montana 59715 · 406-555-0137 · www.marchbanksyoder.example\nDecember 1, 2025\nEverett J. Sundquist and Noor Sundquist\n1885 Sourdough Ridge Road\nBozeman, MT 59715-8802\nDear Everett and Noor:\nThank you for choosing us again. This letter confirms the terms of our engagement to prepare your 2025 federal and Montana individual income tax returns (Form 1040 with Schedule C for Sundquist Field Geology LLC, EIN 81-4471906).\nWhat we will do\nWe will prepare the returns from the information you give us. We will not audit or verify it. You are responsible for the accuracy of the returns and should review them before signing Form 8879. Our work is governed by Circular 230, and we will not disclose your information except as allowed by IRC § 7216.\nWhat we need from you\nPlease upload your documents to the portal at https://portal.marchbanksyoder.example/sundquist by March 2, 2026. Your portal user name is esundquist59715; if the password we set last year (Bridger!Bowl88) no longer works, call the office. We have you on file as SSNs ending 4983 (Everett) and 8373 (Noor); tell us if either is wrong.\nFees\nOur fee for the returns described above is $1,450. Bookkeeping clean-up for the LLC, if needed, is billed at $95 per hour. A deposit of $400.00 is due on signing. Last year's balance of $212.50 remains unpaid and will be added.\nCard on file (optional)\nI authorize Marchbanks & Yoder to charge the card below for the deposit now and for the balance when the returns are ready.\nName on card\tNoor A. Sundquist\nCard number\t4196 6112 9293 7588\nExpires\t11/2028\nSecurity code\t902\nBilling ZIP\t59715\nCell for receipts\t(406) 555-0181\n\nSignatures\nDelphine Marchbanks, CPA (Montana license no. CPA-007418) — delphine@marchbanksyoder.example\nAccepted: ______________________ E. J. Sundquist Date ________\nAccepted: ______________________ N. Sundquist Date ________\nP.S. Noor, you mentioned that your naturalization interview is in February. If USCIS asks for tax transcripts we can pull them with a Form 2848; there is no charge for that.\n\nClient no. 20417 — engagement letter, tax year 2025", "kind": "Word document", "detail": "353 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Everett J. Sundquist", "Noor Sundquist", "Delphine Marchbanks", "E. J. Sundquist", "N. Sundquist"], "companies": ["Marchbanks & Yoder", "Sundquist Field Geology LLC", "USCIS"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Bozeman", "Montana"], "health": ["naturalization interview", "tax transcripts"], "sensitive": ["SSNs"], "names": ["Everett", "Noor"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 1.0999999940395355, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 24, "text": "Marchbanks & Yoder, CPAs", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Marchbanks & Yoder"}, {"start": 26, "end": 50, "text": "Marchbanks & Yoder, CPAs", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Marchbanks & Yoder"}, {"start": 51, "end": 80, "text": "212 West Main Street, Suite 3", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "212 West Main Street, Suite 3"}, {"start": 83, "end": 90, "text": "Bozeman", "kind": "places", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Bozeman"}, {"start": 92, "end": 99, "text": "Montana", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Montana"}, {"start": 100, "end": 105, "text": "59715", "kind": "zip", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "59715"}, {"start": 108, "end": 120, "text": "406-555-0137", "kind": "phone", "source": "patte